# Domain vocabulary for Bucket Foundation. These words collide with the org
# ban lists but name real things here: a canon tier, a directory, a metric.
# One entry per line, matched case-insensitively.
landscape
# Atom-graph field names on the Academy engine, and a public haptic API value.
# These are identifiers; renaming them in comments would desync prose from code.
leverage
unlocks
unlock
# Statistics terms of art in services/research-tools: heterogeneity-robust
# estimators, MAD-robust detection, Mann-Kendall robustness.
robust
# robustness(h) is a named formula in IDEAL-STATE-AND-UNKNOWNS-SPEC.md
# (hypothesis-engine intake) scoring prior-profile spread; also a literal
# bead ID, bkt-hte-surprise-and-robustness.
robustness
# The last word of Tyndall's verbatim 1869 paper title, seeded in
# supabase/seed/research-os-sky-blue.json's provenance field. Never reworded,
# it is a direct quotation of a real citation (doi:10.1098/rspl.1868.0033).
generally
